{"id":1283,"date":"2026-04-01T19:26:34","date_gmt":"2026-04-01T19:26:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aiadvancements.dilatevps1.cloudsites.net.au\/?page_id=1283"},"modified":"2026-08-10T13:14:27","modified_gmt":"2026-08-10T05:14:27","slug":"chatgpt-workshop","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/ai-training\/chatgpt-workshop\/","title":{"rendered":"ChatGPT Workshop"},"content":{"rendered":"    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\n        <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\n\n    <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\n    <section \n        id=\"\" \n        data-name=\"acf_internal-ai-hero\"\n        data-lazyload=\"1\" \n        class=\"relative \" \n        style=\"z-index: 0; background-color:#FFFFFF;\">\n        <div class=\"bg-color5 b1200:pt-200 b767:pt-180 pt-150\">\n            <div class=\"container\">\n                <div class=\"max-w-[898px] mx-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t\t                    <div class=\"text-center flex items-center b1024:mb-14 mb-10\">\n                        <div class=\"h-[32px] w-[32px] rounded-full bg-color2 flex items-center justify-center\">\n                            <svg width=\"19\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 30 13\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M10.1112 0C10.1112 5.75168 5.57492 10.4294 0 10.4294V12.6557C5.60316 12.6557 10.3408 8.76349 11.8042 3.46214V12.6329H13.9649V0H10.11H10.1112Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><path d=\"M19.8559 0H16.001V12.6342H18.1617V3.46214C19.6251 8.76223 24.364 12.6557 29.9659 12.6557V10.4294C24.391 10.4294 19.8547 5.75041 19.8547 0H19.8559Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/><\/svg>\n                        <\/div>\n                        \n                                    <h1 class=\" animate-watch standard__headline inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-color4 py-[11px] px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs super-title\">ChatGPT Training Workshop for Perth Businesses<\/h1>\n                            \n                    <\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                    \n                    \n                        <!-- HEADLINE + SUMMARY -->\n                        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 b1024:grid-cols-2 b1024:mt-16 b767:mt-10 mt-8 b767:gap-y-10 gap-y-8\">\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-end\">\n                                <div class=\"h-full\">\n                                            <h2 class=\"h1 animate-watch standard__headline block tracking-[-0.06em]\">ChatGPT Workshop<\/h2>\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                                <div class=\"button-wrap hidden b1024:inline-flex flex-col b600:flex-row gap-3 mt-[30px] b1024:items-end\">\n                                                <a href=\"#contact-form-section\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 speak-btn flex items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\n                <span class=\"block circle relative\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"button-text z-10\">Book now<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n                                                            <a href=\"\/#services\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-secondary-alt outline-color1 text-center overflow-hidden relative z-10\">\n                Explore Our AI Services            <\/a>\n                                            <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n\n                            <div class=\"b1024:pl-[61px]\">\n                                <p>An interactive ChatGPT Workshop designed to move your team from experimentation to confident, consistent use in a business setting.<\/p>\n<p>We explain how ChatGPT works in practical terms, where it adds value across operations, and how to manage risks around data, accuracy, and misuse. Can be applied in a real business setting in our <a href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/case-study\/advanced-chatgpt-training-workshop\/\">Tusk Finance case study<\/a><strong>.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The session is fully hands-on; participants use ChatGPT live, practice writing effective prompts, refine outputs, and apply it to real workplace scenarios.<\/p>\n<p>Led by AI-native experts, this workshop ensures your team leaves with practical skills they can use immediately.<\/p>\n                                <div class=\"button-wrap inline-flex b1024:hidden flex-col b767:flex-row gap-3 mt-[30px]\">\n                                                <a href=\"#contact-form-section\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 speak-btn flex items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\n                <span class=\"block circle relative\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"button-text z-10\">Book now<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n                                                            <a href=\"\/#services\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-secondary-alt outline-color1 text-center overflow-hidden relative z-10\">\n                Explore Our AI Services            <\/a>\n                                            <\/div>\n                            <\/div>\n                        <\/div>\n\n                                    <\/div>\n\n                                <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 b1024:grid-cols-3 b1200:grid-cols-4 gap-0 pt-60 b767:pt-100 b1024:pb-24 b767:pb-20 pb-12\">\n                                            <div class=\"blurb-circle-info bg-color4 rounded-full text-center aspect-square pt-6 b767:pt-[85px] pb-6 px-6 b767:px-40 flex flex-col justify-center b767:gap-8 gap-4\">\n                                                            <div>\n                                    <div class=\"inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-[#FCFBFA] text-color1 py-2 px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs super-title\">\n                                        Duration                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n                                                                                        <h3 class=\"b767:text-[40px] text-xl\">\n                                    3 hours                                <\/h3>\n\n                                                    <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"blurb-circle-info bg-color4 rounded-full text-center aspect-square pt-6 b767:pt-[85px] pb-6 px-6 b767:px-40 flex flex-col justify-center b767:gap-8 gap-4\">\n                                                            <div>\n                                    <div class=\"inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-[#FCFBFA] text-color1 py-2 px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs super-title\">\n                                        Cost                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n                                                                                        <h3 class=\"b767:text-[40px] text-xl\">\n                                    $3,000                                <\/h3>\n\n                                                    <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"blurb-circle-info bg-color4 rounded-full text-center aspect-square pt-6 b767:pt-[85px] pb-6 px-6 b767:px-40 flex flex-col justify-center b767:gap-8 gap-4\">\n                                                            <div>\n                                    <div class=\"inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-[#FCFBFA] text-color1 py-2 px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs super-title\">\n                                        Format                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n                                                                                        <div class=\"b767:text-[30px] text-base b767:leading-8\">\n                                    In-person, interactive workshop                                <\/div>\n                                                    <\/div>\n                                            <div class=\"blurb-circle-info bg-color4 rounded-full text-center aspect-square pt-6 b767:pt-[85px] pb-6 px-6 b767:px-40 flex flex-col justify-center b767:gap-8 gap-4\">\n                                                            <div>\n                                    <div class=\"inline-flex font-semibold text-color1 bg-[#FCFBFA] text-color1 py-2 px-6 rounded-3xl text-xs super-title\">\n                                        Group size                                    <\/div>\n                                <\/div>\n                                                                                        <h3 class=\"b767:text-[40px] text-xl\">\n                                    1-20 people                                <\/h3>\n\n                                                    <\/div>\n                                    <\/div>\n                \n            <\/div>\n            \n                        <div class=\"internal-hero-video video-expand-wrapper\">\n\n                <div class=\"hero-video-wrapper relative\">\n\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <!-- MEDIA -->\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <div class=\"desktop-media\">\n\n                        \n                        \n                            <!-- DESKTOP VIDEO -->\n                                                        <div class=\"hero-oembed desktop-only w-full h-full\">\n                                <iframe \n                                    src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1184847144?autoplay=0&#038;muted=0&#038;background=0&#038;controls=1\" \n                                    frameborder=\"0\" \n                                    allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" \n                                    allowfullscreen>\n                                <\/iframe>\n                            <\/div>\n\n                            <!-- MOBILE VIDEO -->\n                                                        <div class=\"hero-oembed mobile-only w-full h-full\">\n                                <iframe \n                                    src=\"https:\/\/player.vimeo.com\/video\/1184843946?autoplay=0&#038;muted=0&#038;background=0&#038;controls=1\" \n                                    frameborder=\"0\" \n                                    allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" \n                                    allowfullscreen>\n                                <\/iframe>\n                            <\/div>\n\n                        \n                    <\/div>\n\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <!-- THUMBNAIL -->\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                                            <div class=\"video-thumbnail absolute inset-0 z-20\">\n                            <picture class=\"w-full h-full\"><source media=\"(min-width: 481px)\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Mask-group9.jpg\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"w-full h-full\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Mask-group9.jpg\" alt=\"AI Advancements trainer with glasses presenting a Welcome ChatGPT Training slide on a large monitor to a workshop participant, representing corporate ChatGPT training delivery\" style=\"object-fit:cover;object-position:center;\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1440\" height=\"574\" \/><\/picture>                        <\/div>\n                    \n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                    <!-- PLAY BUTTON -->\n                    <!-- ===================== -->\n                                            <button class=\"video-toggle absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-30\">\n                            <span class=\"play-btn flex items-center justify-center\">\n                                <svg width=\"98\" height=\"98\" viewBox=\"0 0 98 98\" fill=\"none\">\n                                    <circle cx=\"49\" cy=\"49\" r=\"49\" fill=\"#FCFF6A\"\/>\n                                    <path d=\"M68 49L39.5 65.4545L39.5 32.5455L68 49Z\" fill=\"#131924\"\/>\n                                <\/svg>\n                            <\/span>\n                        <\/button>\n                    \n                <\/div>\n\n            <\/div>\n                    <\/div>\n\n        <style>\n        @media (min-width: 767px) {\n            .blurb-circle-info {\n                justify-content: unset;\n            }\n        }\n        <\/style>\n    <\/section>\n    <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\n\n    \n\n  <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n    <!-- GUTENBERG EDITOR BLOCK PREVIEW - DO NOT REMOVE  -->\r\n \r\n  <!-- BLOCK CODING STARTS HERE -->\r\n<section\r\n      id=\"\"\r\n      data-name=\"acf_approach-tab\"\r\n      data-lazyload=\"1\"\r\n      class=\"relative \"\r\n      style=\"z-index: 0;\">\r\n    <div class=\"b1024:py-[124px] py-[80px] bg-color3 list-bg\" style=\"background-color: #ffffff\">\r\n        <div class=\"container\">\r\n            <div class=\"max-w-[1130px] mx-auto\">\r\n                <div class=\"approach-title max-w-[664px] mx-auto b767:mb-[74px] mb-12 text-center two-column-content\">\r\n                                            <div class=\"heading-wrap flex-1\">\r\n                                    <h2 class=\"h2 animate-watch standard__headline block mb-10\">What to expect from <br>the session<\/h2>\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                        <div class=\"summary-wrap ml-auto\">\r\n                                                    <div class=\"approach-text\">\r\n                                <p>Our ChatGPT Workshop is practical, interactive, and grounded in real business use. Your team won\u2019t sit through theory-heavy slides or generic demos. Instead, we focus on how ChatGPT is actually used inside organisations today, and where caution is required.<\/p>\n<p>During the workshop, you can expect:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>A clear explanation of how large language models work, without technical overload.<\/li>\n<li>Live demonstrations of ChatGPT features, including advanced capabilities most teams never use.<\/li>\n<li>Practical guidance on writing effective prompts and avoiding common mistakes.<\/li>\n<li>Open discussion around risks such as data handling, accuracy, and misuse.<\/li>\n<li>Real examples of how teams are using ChatGPT to reduce manual effort and speed up work.<\/li>\n<li>Hands-on time to build custom workflows inside ChatGPT, with expert guidance throughout.<\/li>\n<li>Time for questions, scenarios, and discussion specific to your organisation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>This <a href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/ai-training\/\">AI training<\/a> ensures your team leaves with the confidence and clarity to use ChatGPT effectively, safely, and in ways that make sense for your business context.<\/p>\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                                \r\n                                                    <div class=\"button-wrap flex flex-col b767:flex-row items-center justify-center b1024:justify-start gap-6 overflow-hidden mt-9\">\r\n\r\n                                                                    <a class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 inline-flex items-center gap-4 overflow-hidden\" href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/contact\/\" target=\"_self\">\r\n                                        <span class=\"circle relative\"><\/span>\r\n                                        <div class=\"button-text z-10\">Speak to us<\/div>\r\n                                    <\/a>\r\n                                \r\n                                                                    <a class=\"button download-btn font-bold\" href=\"\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/05\/ChatGPT-Workshop.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">\r\n                                        <span class=\"download-svg\">\r\n                                           <svg width=\"13\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 13 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                                                <path d=\"M12.7978 8.10479L11.0933 6.31942L7.69889 9.87504V0H5.29148V9.87504L1.89704 6.31942L0.192593 8.10479L6.49037 14.7016L12.7881 8.10479H12.7978ZM0 15.4783V18H13V15.4783H0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"\/>\r\n                                            <\/svg>\r\n                                        <\/span>\r\n                                        <span class=\"download-btn-text\">\r\n                                            Download course overview                                        <\/span>\r\n                                        <span class=\"download-hover-svg\">\r\n                                           <svg width=\"13\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 13 18\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\">\r\n                                                <path d=\"M12.7978 8.10479L11.0933 6.31942L7.69889 9.87504V0H5.29148V9.87504L1.89704 6.31942L0.192593 8.10479L6.49037 14.7016L12.7881 8.10479H12.7978ZM0 15.4783V18H13V15.4783H0Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"\/>\r\n                                            <\/svg>\r\n                                        <\/span>\r\n                                    <\/a>\r\n                                \r\n                            <\/div>\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                <\/div>\r\n            <\/div>\r\n        <\/div>\r\n        <div class=\"approach-content\">\r\n\r\n            <!-- TAB BUTTONS -->\r\n            <div class=\"tab-button-group flex justify-center gap-6 mb-11\">\r\n                                                                                                <button class=\"tab-button\" data-tab=\"0\">\r\n                                                    <\/button>\r\n                                                <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- TAB CONTENT -->\r\n            <div class=\"tab-contents\">\r\n\r\n                                                        \r\n                    <div class=\"tab-content-list transition-opacity duration-300\">\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            01                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/AIA_280125_1410-1.jpg\" alt=\"AI Advancements consultant focused on typing at a keyboard with potted plants visible in the office background, representing ChatGPT Workshop training sessions\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Intro to large language models                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Intro to large language models                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/AIA_280125_1410-1.jpg\" alt=\"AI Advancements consultant focused on typing at a keyboard with potted plants visible in the office background, representing ChatGPT Workshop training sessions\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>Our ChatGPT training begins with a clear, non-technical introduction to large language models (LLMs). We explain what a large language model is, how ChatGPT fits into this category, and why these tools behave the way they do.<\/p>\n<p>Common misconceptions are addressed early, helping participants understand limitations, reliability, and where caution is required. This stage sets the foundation for using ChatGPT realistically and responsibly in a business context.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            02                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Collect-and-prioritise-AI-use-case.jpg\" alt=\"Person working at a large monitor displaying code or terminal, representing the AI strategy step to collect and prioritise AI use cases\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Chat GPT basics                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Chat GPT basics                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Collect-and-prioritise-AI-use-case.jpg\" alt=\"Person working at a large monitor displaying code or terminal, representing the AI strategy step to collect and prioritise AI use cases\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>We then move into the core fundamentals of using ChatGPT effectively. Participants learn how to identify suitable business use cases, write clear and effective prompts, and avoid the most common mistakes that lead to poor outputs.<\/p>\n<p>The session covers essential functionality, including starting new chats, using chat history, editing messages, retrying responses, selecting the appropriate model, and uploading files. We also explain multimodality, showing how ChatGPT works with images and different input types.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            03                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Design-development-and-deployment.jpg\" alt=\"Two AI developers in dark shirts collaborating on a laptop in a workshop setting, representing the AI development phase of design, development and deployment\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Customising ChatGPT                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Customising ChatGPT                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Design-development-and-deployment.jpg\" alt=\"Two AI developers in dark shirts collaborating on a laptop in a workshop setting, representing the AI development phase of design, development and deployment\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>This stage focuses on tailoring ChatGPT to better suit individual roles and workflows. We demonstrate how custom instructions, prompt engineering, memory, projects, and custom GPTs can be used to improve consistency, relevance, and efficiency.<\/p>\n<p>The emphasis is on reducing repetition and aligning ChatGPT\u2019s outputs with the way your team actually works, rather than relying on generic responses.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-row\">\r\n                                <div class=\"tab-content-inner gap-5 b767:gap-0 flex-col b767:flex-row\">\r\n                                    <div class=\"number-and-image w-full flex gap-4 justify-start b767:justify-between b767:w-2\/5\">\r\n                                        <div class=\"row-number text-[40px] b767:text-[80px] b991:text-[100px] leading-[1] text-[#131924]\">\r\n                                            04                                        <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:block\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refine-standardise-and-scale-1.jpg\" alt=\"Developer working at a large monitor displaying code, representing the process to refine, standardise, and scale AI solutions\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"title-wraper b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                \r\n                                                                                                    <div class=\"h3 b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                        Advanced features                                                    <\/div>\r\n                                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    <div class=\"tab-content-title w-full b767:w-1\/2 b767:pt-10 flex gap-3 items-center b767:block\">\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <h3 class=\"hidden b767:block pb-[28px]\">\r\n                                                Advanced features                                            <\/h3>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                                                            <div class=\"tab-content-image hidden b767:hidden\">\r\n                                                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/04\/Refine-standardise-and-scale-1.jpg\" alt=\"Developer working at a large monitor displaying code, representing the process to refine, standardise, and scale AI solutions\">\r\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                        \r\n                                                                                    <div class=\"tab-content-description w-full b767:w-full\">\r\n                                                <p>The final stage explores advanced ChatGPT capabilities that are often underused or misunderstood. Participants see live demonstrations of web search, research workflows, editing with Canvas, and image generation.<\/p>\n<p>We also discuss when these features are appropriate to use, where risks arise, and how to apply them sensibly within business environments without creating dependency or compliance issues.<\/p>\n                                            <\/div>\r\n                                                                            <\/div>\r\n                                <\/div>\r\n                            <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                                \r\n                    <\/div>\r\n\r\n                                    \r\n            <\/div>\r\n\r\n            <!-- TAB BUTTONS -->\r\n            <div class=\"tab-button-group flex justify-center gap-6 mt-11\">\r\n                                                                                                <button class=\"tab-button\" data-tab=\"0\">\r\n                                                    <\/button>\r\n                                                