d__headline block mb-6 b767:mb-10\">Wanting to get <br>more value from ChatGPT?<\/h2>\n                            <\/div>\n                                                                <div class=\"hero-summary b1024:max-w-[438px] my-10 b1024:my-16\">\n                            <p>Our ChatGPT workshop is designed for organisations that want their teams using AI with confidence, consistency, and purpose.<\/p>\n<p>We help you move beyond experimentation by showing what works in practice, where risks sit, and how ChatGPT should be used across real business workflows.<\/p>\n<p>Speak with our team to discuss your priorities, your team size, and whether this workshop is the right fit, or how it can be tailored to your environment to deliver the most practical impact.<\/p>\n                        <\/div>\n                                        <div class=\"button-wrap flex flex-col b767:flex-row items-center justify-center b1024:justify-start gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\n                                    <a href=\"https:\/\/aiadvancements.com.au\/contact\/\" target=\"\" class=\"btn btn-solidcolor1 speak-btn flex items-center gap-3 overflow-hidden\">\n                <span class=\"block circle relative\"><\/span>\n                <span class=\"button-text z-10\">Speak to our team<\/span>\n            <\/a>\n                                                <a href=\"\/#services\" target=\"\" class=\"btn outline-color1 text-center overflow-hidden relative z-10\">\n                Our AI services            <\/a>\n                                <\/div>\n                <\/div>\n                <div class=\"iwt-img relative\">\n                                                                                    <div class=\"overlay-border-color2\"><\/div>\n                        <div class=\"ai-text-three text-xs bg-color2 leading-none pt-[5px] pb-[6px] px-[9px] rounded-3xl\">&lt;ai.advancements&gt;<\/div>\n                                                                <